sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  participant Worker
  participant Coordinator as API internal routes
  participant Redis
  Worker->>Worker: Connect to MongoDB and Redis
  Worker->>Worker: Start HTTP server
  Worker->>Coordinator: POST /internal/workers/register
  Coordinator->>Redis: Write worker JSON and heartbeat time
  Redis-->>Coordinator: Stored
  Coordinator-->>Worker: Registration response
  loop Every heartbeat interval
    Worker->>Worker: Read local /health
    Worker->>Coordinator: POST /internal/workers/heartbeat
    Coordinator->>Redis: Update worker hash
    Redis-->>Coordinator: Updated or missing
    alt Registration missing
      Worker->>Coordinator: POST /internal/workers/register
    end
    Worker->>Coordinator: Acquire or renew singleton lease
  end
